/target

# Whatever anyone wraps the build and copy in. What to build and where to put it is in the
# README; a script doing it is one person's workflow, and the last one carried that person's
# machine in it.
/scripts

# This machine's own notes: where the local workflow and the decompiled games are.
/CLAUDE.local.md

# This machine's scratch: work that is not a build output.
/tmp

# vpatch's own redistributable, kept beside the tree for reference rather than
# vendored: orb does the same jobs itself now, and its readme is the reference
# worth having, not the binaries. Drop this line to vendor it.
/vpatch_rev4
